### Summary

I found nothing new to flag. The deferred color upgrade now has its own marker and no longer overwrites a folder that changed while it was away. The same-folder relocate early return and the 'result unknown' handling for rejected IPC calls match the code and their tests. Of the six open threads, four are addressed; the pendingInit thread is only partly addressed, and the dropPendingCaptures one is unchanged.

<details><summary>What the change connects to (2 closed, 0 open)</summary>

Questions the reviewer answered about what this change does to the running product. The engine checked that the cited lines exist, not that the answers are true.

**Closed, with the lines they rest on**
- Deferred brand-color upgrade now uses its own marker pendingColorUpgrade, written to the folder only if the folder still holds the old Default and rose (`apps/kaipu-record/src/main/workspaces/registry.ts:681`) — Default workspace shows the Kaipu color; a rename or recolor from another Mac is kept. If it fails: If the write throws, the marker stays and the next probe retries. In a read-only folder the upgrade is dropped and the cache follows the folder. Evidence: `apps/kaipu-record/src/main/workspaces/registry.ts:681-690`, `apps/kaipu-record/src/main/workspaces/registry.ts:694-707`, `apps/kaipu-record/src/main/workspaces/registry.ts:629`.
- Change folder on the folder the workspace already points at returns early; a pendingInit workspace accepts a moved folder that has .kaipu and no identity (`apps/kaipu-record/src/main/workspaces/relocate.ts:43`) — No Save/Discard prompt and no route remount on a no-op pick. A pendingInit workspace can be repointed to a remounted folder. If it fails: A pendingInit entry still refuses a moved folder that holds another id's identity, although availability() would adopt that id (open thread). A rejected relocate IPC now shows an 'uncertain' message… Evidence: `apps/kaipu-record/src/main/workspaces/relocate.ts:37-46`, `apps/kaipu-record/src/main/workspaces/registry.ts:835-850`, `apps/kaipu-record/src/main/workspaces/registry.ts:711-721`, `apps/kaipu-record/src/renderer/src/features/workspaces/workspaces-context.tsx:174-181`, `apps/kaipu-record/src/renderer/src/features/workspaces/workspace-dialog.tsx:144-151`.

